{
  "title": "VPC Endpoint · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "인터넷 게이트웨이·NAT 없이 지원 서비스에 접근하는 사설 경로다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Endpoint</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#gateway-endpoint\">Gateway Endpoint</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#interface-endpoint\">Interface Endpoint</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#gateway-load-balancer-endpoint\">Gateway Load Balancer Endpoint</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#resource-endpoint\">Resource Endpoint</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#service-network-endpoint\">Service-network Endpoint</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#tunnel-endpoint\">Tunnel Endpoint</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#endpoint-policy-and-private-dns\">Endpoint Policy and Private DNS</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>58 / 62</span></div><h1>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Endpoint</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 7 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Endpoint는 인터넷 진입 없이 특정 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 서비스나 공유 리소스에 접근하는 연결 리소스다. 모든 Endpoint가 같은 방식으로 Route를 설정하거나 같은 비용 구조를 갖는 것은 아니다.</p><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#gateway-endpoint\">Gateway Endpoint</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#interface-endpoint\">PrivateLink</a>를 사용하지 않고, Interface 등 다른 지원 유형은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#interface-endpoint\">PrivateLink</a>를 사용한다. 전체 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> 간 통신이 필요한 Peering·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>와 특정 서비스·리소스 접근을 구분한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Gateway Endpoint와 Interface Endpoint\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Gateway Endpoint와 Interface Endpoint</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Gateway Endpoint</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Private <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/\">DynamoDB</a> 요청</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></strong><small>서비스 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Prefix</a> List 경로</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Service</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#gateway-endpoint\">Gateway Endpoint</a> Policy 평가</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Interface Endpoint</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Private <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></strong><small>지원 서비스 이름 조회</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#endpoint-policy-and-private-dns\">Private DNS</a> → <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a></strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#interface-endpoint\">PrivateLink</a> 경로</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Service</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>·Endpoint·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> 평가</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#gateway-load-balancer\">Gateway Load Balancer</a>·Resource·Service-network·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#tunnel-endpoint\">Tunnel Endpoint</a>는 별도 사용 목적이 있다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"gateway-endpoint\"><h2>Gateway Endpoint<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#gateway-endpoint\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/\">DynamoDB</a> 접근용이다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a>에 서비스 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Prefix</a> List 경로를 연결하며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>를 생성하는 방식이 아니다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a> 없이 해당 서비스에 접근할 수 있고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#gateway-endpoint\">Gateway Endpoint</a> 자체에 추가 요금이 없다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"interface-endpoint\"><h2>Interface Endpoint<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#interface-endpoint\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>선택한 Subnet에 Endpoint <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>를 만들고 Private IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>로 지원 서비스에 연결한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#endpoint-policy-and-private-dns\">Private DNS</a>를 구성한다. 시간·데이터 처리 비용이 있으므로 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 필요성과 트래픽을 함께 판단한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"gateway-load-balancer-endpoint\"><h2>Gateway Load Balancer Endpoint<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#gateway-load-balancer-endpoint\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Network Appliance를 통과하도록 Route를 구성하는 Endpoint다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#gateway-load-balancer\">Gateway Load Balancer</a>가 Firewall·Inspection Appliance에 트래픽을 분산한다. 웹 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>의 Private 진입점과는 다른 용도다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"resource-endpoint\"><h2>Resource Endpoint<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#resource-endpoint\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>에서 공유한 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>, Domain 또는 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> 기반 Resource에 접근한다. 해당 유형은 전통적인 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">NLB</a> 기반 Endpoint Service 없이 리소스에 직접 연결할 수 있다. Resource Gateway와 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> RAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Resource Access Manager)</span> 공유 구성을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"service-network-endpoint\"><h2>Service-network Endpoint<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#service-network-endpoint\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> Lattice Service Network에 연결해 그 Network에 속한 여러 Service·Resource에 접근한다. 개별 서비스마다 별도 Endpoint를 만드는 모델과 차이가 있다. Lattice의 서비스 접근 정책도 함께 적용된다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"tunnel-endpoint\"><h2>Tunnel Endpoint<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#tunnel-endpoint\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>·계정에서 공유한 Network Segment에 연결하는 유형이다. GENEVE Encapsulation이 필요한 사용 방식이며 일반 HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#interface-endpoint\">Interface Endpoint</a>처럼 단순 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 연결만 하는 모델이 아니다. 현재 지원 범위와 Network 설정을 문서에서 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"endpoint-policy-and-private-dns\"><h2>Endpoint Policy and Private DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#endpoint-policy-and-private-dns\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#endpoint-policy-and-private-dns\">Endpoint Policy</a>는 경유 요청에 적용하는 추가 권한 경계이며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>·Resource Policy를 대체하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#endpoint-policy-and-private-dns\">Private DNS</a>는 서비스 이름을 Endpoint의 Private IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>로 해석하게 한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>, Network 허용, 서비스 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> 권한을 모두 확인한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>Private <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>만 사용한다면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#gateway-endpoint\">Gateway Endpoint</a>부터 검토한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a> 같은 지원 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>에 Private 접근할 때는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#interface-endpoint\">Interface Endpoint</a>와 그 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 구성을 확인한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>게이트웨이 엔드포인트와 인터페이스 엔드포인트의 대상·경로·과금 구조를 구별한다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/privatelink/concepts.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vpc/latest/privatelink/concepts.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q017\" data-question=\"Q017\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q017</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A private EC2 instance needs access to S3 without routing S3 traffic through a NAT gateway. What is usually the simplest choice?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A public Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">라우트 테이블</a>을 통해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 사설 경로를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q018\" data-question=\"Q018\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q018</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q018/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company creates an ENI with a private IP address in a private subnet to access an AWS service. Which endpoint type is this?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q018\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q018\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A transit gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q018\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q018\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An interface endpoint</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 인터페이스 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#interface-endpoint\">PrivateLink</a> 기반 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>에 만든다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q083\" data-question=\"Q083\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q083</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q083/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs to access only S3. Which TWO components reduce NAT usage and internet exposure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Configure the subnet&#x27;s route table</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an Elastic IP address to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Require a default route to an internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Create an S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow inbound access from 0.0.0.0/0</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, D</strong> · 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 적절한 라우트 연결을 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 접근에 공인 주소나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>가 필수는 아니다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q010\" data-question=\"Q010\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q010</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q010/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs outbound IPv4 access to an internet package repository. What is a typical design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A NAT gateway in a public subnet and a route from the private subnet to it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach an internet gateway directly to the private subnet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy only CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a Route 53 failover policy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · 퍼블릭 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>를 통해 외부 연결을 시작하고 응답받는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q011\" data-question=\"Q011\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q011</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q011/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application runs in two Availability Zones and uses zonal public NAT gateways. If one AZ fails, workloads in the surviving AZ must retain outbound internet access. Which NAT design should the architect use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Add only a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a single NAT gateway in AZ A</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy a NAT gateway in each AZ and route each subnet to its local NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach one Elastic IP to both AZs simultaneously</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>와 경로는 단일 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a> 의존을 제거하고 교차 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 트래픽도 줄인다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">이전 용어 <b>VPC</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">다음 용어 <b>VPC Peering</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
